  "description": "Framework .NET 8+ para CQRS, Event-Driven e Microsserviços. Mediator com Pipeline Behaviors, EventBus multi-provider (InMemory/RabbitMQ/Kafka), Outbox, Inbox, Saga, Scheduled Messages, Retry, DLQ, OpenTelemetry, Module System, Handler Discovery, Execution Scope, Diagnostics Context e Source Generator.",
  "id": "FlowCore",
  "isPrerelease": false,
